WEBVTT

00:30.030 --> 00:35.035
DATEN CITY PRESIDENT

00:41.834 --> 00:43.877
P-P-Panty!

00:43.878 --> 00:48.381
She's been sentenced to d-d-death!

00:48.382 --> 00:51.426
- Death... Death... Death...
- It's far too early for all this noise.

00:51.427 --> 00:55.431
Daten City doesn't let rape fly anymore.
Now, they give you the chair.

00:56.140 --> 00:59.809
Well, that slattern's not exactly known
for her monastic tendencies, am I right?

00:59.810 --> 01:01.227
An apt observation, dear sister.

01:01.228 --> 01:02.604
Poor, poor Panty!

01:02.605 --> 01:04.230
Who? Who would make such a law?

01:04.231 --> 01:06.775
That would be the president.
He passed this law this morning.

01:06.776 --> 01:08.903
The president? I'll presi-dent him!

01:09.653 --> 01:11.446
- Who's the president?
- Are you that naive?

01:11.447 --> 01:13.282
Everyone's calling him a total hunk.

01:13.866 --> 01:14.991
He's not just a pretty face!

01:14.992 --> 01:18.495
He clawed his way out of poverty
right through law school, and with honors!

01:18.496 --> 01:20.872
He saved a dog from drowning,
and then he adopted it!

01:20.873 --> 01:23.291
He likes jogging,
and his favorite food is chicken salad.

01:23.292 --> 01:25.919
He's dating a model,
but they're saving it for marriage.

01:25.920 --> 01:28.713
He's a hearty, heartwarming,
heartthrob of a president!

01:28.714 --> 01:32.300
Be that as it may, we gotta change
this law if we wanna save Panty.

01:32.301 --> 01:34.303
Impossible! How can we possibly--

01:35.012 --> 01:36.179
We can!

01:36.180 --> 01:38.891
That's right!
"Pick Your President" day is next week!

01:39.475 --> 01:41.100
"Pick Your President Day"?

01:41.101 --> 01:44.270
Yeah! The presidency is open
to any and all species within the city.

01:44.271 --> 01:47.816
- All life forms can run in the election.
- What a joke of a city.

01:47.817 --> 01:50.151
We could run in the election
and change the law ourselves!

01:50.152 --> 01:54.364
Just you wait, Panty.
I'll run for president and be top--

01:54.365 --> 01:55.615
Of the loser board!

01:55.616 --> 01:58.952
I'm just a chewed out wad of gum
stuck on the tip of your boot.

01:58.953 --> 02:02.580
I'd be no match for such a beautiful,
chaste, and upstanding man.

02:02.581 --> 02:04.499
But what if you two ran?

02:04.500 --> 02:06.751
You used to be the popular kids,
so I bet you'd have--

02:06.752 --> 02:07.961
No chance in hell!

02:07.962 --> 02:11.172
Like hell a demon from Hell
would win in the election.

02:11.173 --> 02:13.925
Garter! You're a priest? You'd be a sure--

02:13.926 --> 02:15.093
Fail!

02:15.094 --> 02:17.554
You've embezzled
so much money from the church,

02:17.555 --> 02:20.057
and if the Internet finds out,
you'd be canceled for sure.

02:20.766 --> 02:23.810
What about Stocking? She might--

02:23.811 --> 02:25.687
She's an angel. She's cute. Got smarts.

02:25.688 --> 02:27.647
Mean as hell, but we can hide that.

02:27.648 --> 02:30.233
Her toy, Honekoneko,
might bring out the cat-lovers.

02:30.234 --> 02:32.569
She could pull a bunch
of jealous simps as well.

02:32.570 --> 02:34.028
She ticks all the niche boxes.

02:34.029 --> 02:37.241
The angel! The angel might just...

02:39.827 --> 02:40.827
stand a chance!

02:40.828 --> 02:43.997
Stocking! You're our next president!

02:43.998 --> 02:45.082
Me?

02:48.002 --> 02:50.837
When I become president,

02:50.838 --> 02:56.802
<i>there will be free sex, violence,
freedom, and sweets for all!</i>

02:57.511 --> 02:58.554
Put your faith in me.

03:01.432 --> 03:03.766
Maybe we went too hard
for the niche votes.

03:03.767 --> 03:05.936
Good. Let's do things my way now.

03:06.562 --> 03:09.606
Left. Left. Left, right, left...

03:09.607 --> 03:11.232
Hey. You're the president, right?

03:11.233 --> 03:13.776
That's right. Have I got your vote?

03:13.777 --> 03:15.612
If you don't wanna end up
in a fucking ditch,

03:15.613 --> 03:18.197
you'll back out of this election, now!

03:18.198 --> 03:20.491
No, Stocking! Not like this!

03:20.492 --> 03:22.535
Don't get your panties in a twist.
It's a heavenly weapon.

03:22.536 --> 03:23.786
It doesn't work on humans.

03:23.787 --> 03:26.957
But what if someone sees you?

03:27.791 --> 03:29.793
- Uh...
- You did it.

03:33.130 --> 03:35.006
- Looks like it works to me!
- No shit!

03:35.007 --> 03:36.633
I thought it didn't work on humans?

03:36.634 --> 03:39.178
Which means... he's a Ghost?

03:40.512 --> 03:42.013
Uh-oh, you got me.

03:42.014 --> 03:44.766
Seems I'm your first ever Ghost president.

03:44.767 --> 03:47.435
The President of Business!

03:47.436 --> 03:48.853
- President of what?
- Business?

03:48.854 --> 03:51.189
But what about being chaste?
What about being a virgin?

03:51.190 --> 03:52.523
A business virgin.

03:52.524 --> 03:54.484
I've got 40 or 50
business baddies on the side.

03:54.485 --> 03:56.402
We're always doin' the deed!
The business deed!

03:56.403 --> 04:00.114
What about coming from nothing
and clawing your way through law school?

04:00.115 --> 04:04.452
All part of the deal in business.
And my business is in heartwarming tales.

04:04.453 --> 04:07.413
The dog! What about that dog
you saved from the river?

04:07.414 --> 04:11.627
A business transaction!
His business is dressing up as a dog.

04:12.127 --> 04:13.169
You bullshittin' me?

04:13.170 --> 04:14.879
It's all just business, my boy.

04:14.880 --> 04:18.257
Business, my ass!
You're just a plain old liar!

04:18.258 --> 04:24.222
In this day and age, the only ones with
business in an election are the saints.

04:24.223 --> 04:27.308
My business is in getting
everything done through business.

04:27.309 --> 04:29.228
I'm the President of Business!

04:29.853 --> 04:31.522
This Ghost is obsessed with authority.

04:32.022 --> 04:34.483
Cool. Then let's shut
this shit down nice and quickly.

04:35.651 --> 04:38.486
O, evil spirits born of those lost
between heaven and earth!

04:38.487 --> 04:40.489
May the thunder from the garments...

04:42.908 --> 04:48.372
Business!

04:52.710 --> 04:54.335
Well done, Miss President!

04:54.336 --> 04:57.047
We blew our rival out of the ball park!

04:58.007 --> 05:00.592
Stocking is sure to win now.

05:02.094 --> 05:04.595
<i>Stocking has lost with only four votes.</i>

05:04.596 --> 05:06.556
- Fuck!
- Fuck!

05:06.557 --> 05:08.307
- So, uh...
- Fuck?

05:08.308 --> 05:11.769
- I didn't win, so you still get the chair.
- Fuck?

05:11.770 --> 05:14.481
- Sorry, bebs.
- Fuck you and fuck your sorry!

05:15.649 --> 05:18.192
- Panty's gonna die...
- Any last words, Panty?

05:18.193 --> 05:21.195
Garter! You're good with bribes.
Why not put your skills to use?

05:21.196 --> 05:24.365
Garter pays his tithes in lint and IOUs.
You think he can afford a bribe?

05:24.366 --> 05:25.700
Too right, dear sister.

05:25.701 --> 05:28.662
Hey, bitches. Enjoying the show?
Why not be useful for a change--

05:29.747 --> 05:31.999
- What? I'm kinda busy.
- She's still kicking, huh?

05:32.499 --> 05:34.418
- Pardoned? What?
- Maybe it needs more juice?

05:35.335 --> 05:36.878
The new president pardoned Panty?

05:36.879 --> 05:39.255
She's pardoned?

05:39.256 --> 05:40.339
Yay!

05:40.340 --> 05:44.260
Truly, a pardon by the new president
must be the work of God.

05:44.261 --> 05:45.887
Good to have you back, Panty.

05:45.888 --> 05:48.306
Beats me, but I ain't complaining.

05:48.307 --> 05:51.769
So who is this new president, anyway?

06:01.028 --> 06:05.991
PET CEMETERY HILLS

06:11.747 --> 06:14.457
So basically, while I'm tailing the Ghost,

06:14.458 --> 06:17.210
you decide to take
a little detour to pound town

06:17.211 --> 06:18.461
and end up getting the car towed?

06:18.462 --> 06:19.837
I don't believe it either.

06:19.838 --> 06:22.840
And they say I gotta wait
till next morning for See-Through.

06:22.841 --> 06:25.135
Maybe those fucking pigs
should do their fucking jobs!

06:26.678 --> 06:28.763
Hey, wasn't that someone's gravestone?

06:28.764 --> 06:31.350
So what? Shoulda thought about that
before putting it in my way.

06:32.726 --> 06:34.811
Don't come crying to me
when your ass gets haunted.

06:34.812 --> 06:36.855
Shut it, horoscope whore.

06:57.167 --> 06:58.585
Will you shut the fuck up!

06:59.294 --> 07:00.796
Huh? Hmm?

07:02.631 --> 07:03.632
Huh?

07:05.968 --> 07:09.387
Oh my God! So freaking adorable!

07:09.388 --> 07:13.933
W-W-What happened, Panty?
Where'd you find this cute little kitty?

07:13.934 --> 07:15.601
It was just on me when I woke up.

07:15.602 --> 07:17.311
Want a treat, little kitty?

07:17.312 --> 07:20.149
Ms. Scanty, for all intents and purposes,
this cat is clearly a Ghost.

07:29.324 --> 07:30.700
Repent for your sins.

07:30.701 --> 07:32.578
Stop!

07:34.705 --> 07:36.873
Panty! What the fuck is wrong with you?

07:36.874 --> 07:39.084
- Heathen! Evil incarnate!
- Look at it... How could you?

07:39.751 --> 07:42.503
What is with you guys? A Ghost is a Ghost.

07:42.504 --> 07:45.047
- Just kill it for the Heaven Coin--
- Don't even bother.

07:45.048 --> 07:50.678
Ain't no soul in the lowlife who destroyed
that poor little kitty's grave last night.

07:50.679 --> 07:55.099
This here little kitty cat is the Ghost
of that pussycat comin' back to bite.

07:55.100 --> 08:00.688
But the thing's so tiny,
it's hardly worth even half a Heaven Coin.

08:00.689 --> 08:03.191
So no point in wasting bullets then, huh?

08:03.192 --> 08:05.067
Can we keep her? Oh please?

08:05.068 --> 08:07.403
- I vote we keep her too.
- Can we, Garter?

08:07.404 --> 08:09.030
Only if you promise to take care of it.

08:09.031 --> 08:11.115
Hmm... If a little puss is only half a coin,

08:11.116 --> 08:15.411
then a big, fat, monster puss
will be worth loads of coins!

08:15.412 --> 08:17.205
We have to give her a name.

08:17.206 --> 08:19.750
It's a girl, so how about "Eve"?

08:20.709 --> 08:25.005
We'll call her "Vibe."
'Cause she's always vibrating.

08:28.592 --> 08:31.427
Huh? All the Hell Churu's are gone.

08:31.428 --> 08:34.431
- I'd better order some more.
- Yes, yes. Eat up, fatty!

08:36.016 --> 08:37.767
Vibey baby!

08:37.768 --> 08:39.810
Come play with me!

08:39.811 --> 08:43.606
Hey, where did all your Ghost-cat toys go?
And all your other toys!

08:43.607 --> 08:46.235
How are we supposed to play?

08:48.403 --> 08:50.446
Good girl, Vibe. Get nice and fat.

08:50.447 --> 08:53.325
Nice and fat,
and we'll both be the fattest cats around!

08:59.748 --> 09:01.249
Okay, you're pretty big now.

09:01.250 --> 09:03.669
I can probably get about
ten Heaven Coins from you by now.

09:10.676 --> 09:12.301
Oh, I just remembered.

09:12.302 --> 09:15.472
I'm getting my insides scrambled
with Mr. Twister today.

09:19.017 --> 09:22.145
Hey, Vibe, you're not living up
to your name so much these days.

09:24.731 --> 09:28.567
All right, all right. I'll get you a nice,
yummy Fish Ghost for when I get back.

09:28.568 --> 09:30.821
Be a good baby
and look after the house, okay?

09:36.743 --> 09:37.994
She's gone!

09:37.995 --> 09:39.870
I'm back, bitches.

09:39.871 --> 09:43.374
- P-P-Panty! Where've you been?
- Huh?

09:43.375 --> 09:45.626
- She's gone!
- Who's gone?

09:45.627 --> 09:46.878
Vibe!

09:52.050 --> 09:53.135
Vibe!

09:59.850 --> 10:01.267
The time has come.

10:01.268 --> 10:02.728
The fuck are you spoutin'?

10:03.645 --> 10:06.689
That Ghost was abandoned by humans.
She had never known love.

10:06.690 --> 10:11.902
But you loved her, Panty,
and now she's ready to move on.

10:11.903 --> 10:13.322
But... I...

10:16.783 --> 10:18.076
Panty.

10:24.082 --> 10:26.417
I had big plans for you, you know?

10:26.418 --> 10:29.546
You were gonna give me
so many Heaven Coins.

10:33.133 --> 10:34.343
Vibe...

11:00.702 --> 11:02.828
Hey, Panty. Hurry!

11:02.829 --> 11:04.914
- Must have overslept. Typical.
- A divine message!

11:04.915 --> 11:06.707
You must go! Panty and Stocking!

11:06.708 --> 11:07.918
Seriously?

11:08.502 --> 11:12.422
Shut up, shut up. I hear you, all right?

11:21.014 --> 11:26.019
SHOOT FOR YESTERDAY!

11:42.619 --> 11:45.371
What in tarnation?
What is goin' on with me cowses?

11:45.372 --> 11:47.624
Oh my gilly golly gizzle!
Oh my ding dang dong!

11:49.000 --> 11:50.084
Oh my Lord...

11:50.085 --> 11:53.171
Cownsarn it!

11:55.799 --> 11:58.676
<i>It's all over, people!
We don't have a prayer!</i>

11:58.677 --> 12:01.345
<i>- Help! Save me!
- Strange dots are attacking the people.</i>

12:01.346 --> 12:05.182
<i>They're metamorphizing the people
and turning them into goddamn freaks!</i>

12:05.183 --> 12:07.184
<i>And what is that descending from above?</i>

12:07.185 --> 12:09.187
<i>Here I am, to chew gum and kick ass.</i>

12:09.771 --> 12:12.315
This fuckin' show slaps! What's it called?

12:12.816 --> 12:15.860
Hey, Garter. Doesn't this look
like the workings of a Ghost to you?

12:15.861 --> 12:17.445
Huh? You mean this is the news?

12:17.446 --> 12:19.613
- No way, pull my other leg.
- Who knows?

12:19.614 --> 12:21.115
- News? Really?
- Get with the program!

12:21.116 --> 12:22.825
If it quacks like a Ghost!

12:22.826 --> 12:23.909
However!

12:23.910 --> 12:25.829
I could be the quack.

12:26.455 --> 12:28.789
You talk out your ass
like it's a TED Talk.

12:28.790 --> 12:31.126
Talk is cheap.
Let's go find out for ourselves.

12:39.050 --> 12:41.218
What y'all runnin' for?

12:41.219 --> 12:43.179
Come here. The beam is your friend.

12:43.180 --> 12:46.390
See? Look how interesting
it makes y'all look!

12:46.391 --> 12:50.686
Whoa! What is happening? And on a Sunday--

12:50.687 --> 12:52.063
He got Geek Boy!

12:52.647 --> 12:53.772
Who are you lot?

12:53.773 --> 12:56.943
You fixin' to start something? Well,
don't just stand there lookin' purdy!

13:03.450 --> 13:06.327
Oh, is this how I ended up?

13:06.328 --> 13:07.579
Oh my God, dude! Your voice!

13:11.666 --> 13:12.876
What a weirdo!

13:13.376 --> 13:15.127
How bizarre.

13:15.128 --> 13:17.630
I do not think it is actually that funny...

13:17.631 --> 13:18.881
More dots!

13:18.882 --> 13:20.383
Watch out, Panty!

13:24.554 --> 13:25.930
What the fuck?

13:25.931 --> 13:28.934
What was that contraption?
A peashooter? Here, more dots!

13:35.482 --> 13:38.108
Bah, knew it. Beam, soft. No power.

13:38.109 --> 13:41.111
If heavenly weapons no work,
this no Ghost.

13:41.112 --> 13:43.322
So a human, yes? An anomalous human?

13:43.323 --> 13:45.033
The beam can only change outer form.

13:45.659 --> 13:48.036
Kneesocks is indeed grunting in agreement.

13:48.662 --> 13:51.498
In that case, it is simple.
In that case, we simply hit it!

13:54.042 --> 13:56.002
You guys look like freaks!
Like, I can't even!

13:56.503 --> 13:57.921
Quiet, wench!

14:01.216 --> 14:04.051
How unfortunate.
Panty is of no use to us now.

14:04.052 --> 14:05.636
Where bad man go?

14:05.637 --> 14:08.889
Over there!
He is firing dots all over the city!

14:08.890 --> 14:11.350
Reckon I'm just about done here.

14:11.351 --> 14:13.978
- Well then, onto the next--
- No, wait!

14:13.979 --> 14:16.355
No! I must ask you to be the ones to wait.

14:16.356 --> 14:17.648
My stars! Another freak!

14:17.649 --> 14:20.859
Please, call me Baywatcher.
And you must be fellow Ghost Hun--

14:20.860 --> 14:22.320
Stocking!

14:23.280 --> 14:24.406
You got him!

14:25.282 --> 14:26.282
YESTERDAY

14:26.283 --> 14:27.409
Halt!

14:28.868 --> 14:31.121
Damn it. I need to stop it...

14:32.080 --> 14:33.289
<i>Baywatcher, come in.</i>

14:33.290 --> 14:35.624
<i>Planet Earth imminent.
If that thing breaches...</i>

14:35.625 --> 14:37.293
BAYWATCHER HQ - DOME'S BAY

14:37.294 --> 14:39.461
Got it. I will stop it.

14:39.462 --> 14:41.715
- <i>Watch out, Baywatcher!</i>
- What?

14:46.678 --> 14:48.512
THE PRESENT

14:48.513 --> 14:50.347
Whatever could that be?

14:50.348 --> 14:52.600
My! Who is this strange-looking man?

14:52.601 --> 14:54.352
Good golly, he must be a criminal!

14:55.020 --> 14:57.688
But that is no reason
not to tend to his wounds.

14:57.689 --> 14:59.524
For I am a nurse!

15:01.109 --> 15:02.526
Goodness, he is coming to.

15:02.527 --> 15:04.320
Where am I?

15:04.321 --> 15:05.780
Why, Daten City.

15:06.364 --> 15:07.449
Daten City?

15:08.491 --> 15:09.617
This place is foreign to me.

15:09.618 --> 15:10.744
Wait...

15:11.328 --> 15:14.413
What's my name? Who even am I?

15:14.414 --> 15:16.916
More dots. More dots. Come on, more dots.

15:17.500 --> 15:18.834
This is terrible.

15:18.835 --> 15:21.629
He keeps shooting those dot beams.
It is impossible to move.

15:21.630 --> 15:23.131
Apologies. I am now present.

15:23.715 --> 15:24.799
- Panty!
- Uh-oh.

15:25.759 --> 15:26.884
Sorry for the delay.

15:26.885 --> 15:28.552
So then your mirth has ended?

15:28.553 --> 15:31.055
I have noticed something.

15:31.056 --> 15:33.432
Look at his forehead.

15:33.433 --> 15:36.269
Notice the black geometric cube.

15:37.145 --> 15:38.228
You are correct!

15:38.229 --> 15:40.856
I think perhaps
that may be part of the Ghost.

15:40.857 --> 15:42.191
You say ghost controlling?

15:42.192 --> 15:44.193
Affirmative! That must be it.

15:44.194 --> 15:48.614
Understood. Then I will distract
the Ghost by saying mean things.

15:48.615 --> 15:51.408
Then you grab it, and destroy it. Okay?

15:51.409 --> 15:53.619
You know what to do. So do it.

15:53.620 --> 15:55.329
Here I go! You can count on me!

15:55.330 --> 15:58.290
He must be the sole descendant
of some farming entity.

15:58.291 --> 16:00.084
He has the eyes of a heifer.

16:00.085 --> 16:02.628
Mention that,
and you are bound to hit a sore spot.

16:02.629 --> 16:04.088
Okay!

16:04.089 --> 16:06.382
Tired. So tired.

16:06.383 --> 16:08.300
Hey! Over here! You piece of cow pat!

16:08.301 --> 16:12.222
Your cow trespassed on my property
and damaged my perimeter vegetation.

16:12.722 --> 16:15.100
Animal behavior strongly correlates
with that of its owner.

16:15.725 --> 16:19.062
I suspect any wealth of yours
is nothing but ill-gotten gains!

16:19.646 --> 16:21.522
Do I offend you? Then come at me bro!

16:21.523 --> 16:25.026
That tongue of yours
is askin' for trouble, kid.

16:25.985 --> 16:27.653
- Quickly...
- Hold still, ya hellion!

16:27.654 --> 16:29.571
Good. The time is now.

16:29.572 --> 16:31.407
- Panty!
- What?

16:31.408 --> 16:33.992
- Stocking!
- Crocodile!

16:33.993 --> 16:35.328
Uh-oh!

16:39.082 --> 16:40.249
What happened?

16:40.250 --> 16:42.543
You were being controlled by a Ghost.

16:42.544 --> 16:46.004
But wait. We broke the black thing,
but I do not hear that bell.

16:46.005 --> 16:48.090
Moreover, I have not
changed back to normal.

16:48.091 --> 16:50.427
- You okay?
- I feel sick...

16:51.469 --> 16:54.346
- What?
- Are you all right, Panty?

16:54.347 --> 16:56.557
I detect another minor shift in structure.

16:56.558 --> 16:59.476
What if just continue life?

16:59.477 --> 17:02.020
Feel better than normal, I do.

17:02.021 --> 17:03.690
You are not wrong.

17:05.108 --> 17:08.987
- Ghosts are not entirely devoid of merit.
- Crocodile, crocodile, crocodile.

17:10.071 --> 17:12.031
THE NEXT DAY

17:17.996 --> 17:19.873
It's a revelation!

17:20.457 --> 17:21.749
Are you all right, my dear?

17:21.750 --> 17:24.376
I remember everything.
My name is Baywatcher.

17:24.377 --> 17:27.046
And furthermore, I have a mission!

17:28.006 --> 17:30.258
I hope I'm not too late!

17:33.344 --> 17:34.887
Something is descending, Panty!

17:34.888 --> 17:36.097
You are correct.

17:36.681 --> 17:39.184
Halt! I am not your enemy.

17:40.643 --> 17:44.063
The enemy is up there. Baywatch!

17:45.648 --> 17:50.278
<i>Little old maw-maw, her hips go...</i>

17:51.029 --> 17:52.822
My name is Tekki!

17:53.406 --> 17:55.699
Oh! Whatever was I doing?

17:55.700 --> 17:59.411
I have to get back to crab fishing
in the Bering Sea right away!

17:59.412 --> 18:00.621
- Whoosh.
- What is going on?

18:00.622 --> 18:04.583
My name is Baywatcher.
I am a Ghost Hunter.

18:04.584 --> 18:06.418
Technically, I am a Space Ghost Hunter.

18:06.419 --> 18:08.337
But that is not the point!

18:08.338 --> 18:10.255
It must be destroyed immediately.

18:10.256 --> 18:12.132
The universe is in grave danger!

18:12.133 --> 18:13.217
"It"?

18:13.218 --> 18:16.136
The Cosmic Monolith Cube
Mother Space Ghost.

18:16.137 --> 18:19.556
It is a Ghost born from the ill-will
of a fourth-dimensional being

18:19.557 --> 18:21.266
who perished via the anti-mojo code!

18:21.267 --> 18:24.895
It distorts time and space,
New Gaddessifying everything in its wake.

18:24.896 --> 18:27.481
What happens
when you are New Gaddessified?

18:27.482 --> 18:30.192
All sexual desire becomes nullified.

18:30.193 --> 18:31.777
All mojo, the essence of life, gone.

18:31.778 --> 18:32.903
That is a grim future.

18:32.904 --> 18:35.823
In fact, I too have not masturbated
nor had intercourse since yesterday.

18:35.824 --> 18:38.283
Shared sweets with beast!

18:38.284 --> 18:39.368
Rude. Am not beast!

18:39.369 --> 18:41.954
But I must say,
the way it's spreading is peculiar.

18:41.955 --> 18:44.748
Perhaps this planet
aids in amplifying its power--

18:44.749 --> 18:47.502
Wait! Panty! Your angel halo is missing!

18:48.086 --> 18:49.169
You don't say?

18:49.170 --> 18:50.629
Look ridiculous.

18:50.630 --> 18:52.381
- Yours is missing too.
- Missing?

18:52.382 --> 18:54.383
And where have our demon tails gone?

18:54.384 --> 18:55.509
This is not my tail. Wait.

18:55.510 --> 18:56.635
Whose tail is this?

18:56.636 --> 18:57.886
The process is now clear!

18:57.887 --> 19:01.391
It is feeding on your powers
and repurposing it to fuel its growth.

19:03.643 --> 19:05.561
We can linger no longer.

19:05.562 --> 19:09.523
If we do not defeat the Cube Ghost,
the universe will collapse into ruin!

19:09.524 --> 19:11.484
Baywatch!

19:12.318 --> 19:13.527
Amazing!

19:13.528 --> 19:17.198
Come, my friends!
I give my life to save this world!

19:19.158 --> 19:21.743
The Ghost is within our grasp.

19:21.744 --> 19:23.453
Hold on tight, and don't let go--

19:23.454 --> 19:24.539
Oh no! Help me!

19:27.917 --> 19:29.710
- Help me!
- Crocodile!

19:29.711 --> 19:31.336
Bad! Cannot--

19:31.337 --> 19:33.298
Are we to taste defeat?

19:33.798 --> 19:36.384
Your advice, Baywatcher!
If the current trajectory persists...

19:39.637 --> 19:41.847
Baywatcher, no...

19:41.848 --> 19:44.474
You cannot!

19:44.475 --> 19:47.228
Everything... It's all my fault...

19:47.729 --> 19:50.773
I crashed into the meteorite,
and I failed to catch the Ghost.

19:51.274 --> 19:53.818
I must correct this error,
even if it costs me my life.

19:54.319 --> 19:56.446
I will return your powers to you!

19:58.865 --> 20:03.620
Baywatch!

20:11.252 --> 20:12.879
Watch!

20:19.302 --> 20:22.555
Now it is up to you...

20:30.772 --> 20:32.607
- Repent!
- Return to the dark!

20:35.610 --> 20:37.444
Fuck! That was some serious crazy shit.

20:37.445 --> 20:39.196
Never. Never again.

20:39.197 --> 20:41.156
You were pretty funny to look at though.

20:41.157 --> 20:43.075
- Shut up, bitch!
- That was disturbing.

20:43.076 --> 20:44.785
Not so fast, you guys.

20:44.786 --> 20:46.913
I still don't hear any bells ringing.

20:47.664 --> 20:48.915
Bell?

20:53.169 --> 20:54.170
Whoa...

21:10.895 --> 21:12.437
<i>I am revived.</i>

21:12.438 --> 21:14.189
A MYSTERIOUS VOICE
ECHOES THROUGH THE VOID

21:14.190 --> 21:16.525
<i>Listen, Panty.
I cannot be the hero this world needs.</i>

21:16.526 --> 21:18.694
<i>Everything has been New Gaddessified.</i>

21:18.695 --> 21:21.363
<i>It is likely to remain so forever more.</i>

21:21.364 --> 21:24.075
<i>But I can send you back into the past.</i>

21:24.575 --> 21:27.494
<i>I can give your gun the power
to transcend time and space.</i>

21:27.495 --> 21:31.331
<i>Shoot, and your bullet will transcend
time and space to send you into the past.</i>

21:31.332 --> 21:35.419
<i>Traverse the timeline to a point
prior to my arrival on this planet,</i>

21:35.420 --> 21:38.464
<i>and destroy the Ghost!</i>

21:38.965 --> 21:39.965
YESTERDAY

21:39.966 --> 21:41.092
Halt!

21:55.690 --> 21:57.358
<i>Whoa! Now something else is appearing!</i>

21:57.859 --> 22:00.068
<i>Holy cow! It's a cow!</i>

22:00.069 --> 22:02.405
<i>I repeat!
We have a cow and a farmer in our midst!</i>

22:10.538 --> 22:12.914
There's more to come, isn't there?

22:12.915 --> 22:16.169
Are you... Are you from the future?

22:16.794 --> 22:20.380
The Cube Ghost may be destroyed,
but that wasn't its true form.

22:20.381 --> 22:23.884
The Ghost actually
resides in the black dots.

22:23.885 --> 22:25.887
That is the true anti-mojo code.

22:26.387 --> 22:29.057
- Am I right?
- Yes.

22:29.640 --> 22:33.435
We, the Space Ghost Hunters,
intend to annihilate them all.

22:33.436 --> 22:35.688
I will annihilate them myself.

22:36.814 --> 22:37.940
But you have...

22:38.608 --> 22:39.900
<i>I know.</i>

22:39.901 --> 22:42.862
<i>This world may be my past,</i>

22:43.571 --> 22:46.741
<i>but it's future does not belong to me.</i>

22:47.366 --> 22:48.909
And so, I--

22:48.910 --> 22:50.535
You are wrong.

22:50.536 --> 22:53.790
Your future belongs to you.

23:01.005 --> 23:02.173
You're right.

23:10.765 --> 23:12.934
- Let's go!
- Right.

23:16.145 --> 23:17.939
What the hell was that for, slut?

23:18.523 --> 23:20.525
Hey, I'm talkin' to you, bitch!

24:51.908 --> 24:53.910
Subtitle: Daisy Savage & Rychelle Brittain
